#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:26
msgid "My mistress says the Arcanum has a witchlight going spare. Anything enchanted glows by it, and nobody else can see. {price}... she says."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:27
msgid "Oh good! Don't let it go out: it's older than the Guild."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:27
msgid "That's all right. I'll ask again when she sends me."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:29
msgid "Lantern Lane's auctions would take a Keywright's goods. An auction block in your shop, and buyers bid against each other: {price}."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:30
msgid "Done. My cut is my own business."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:30
msgid "As you like. Pledges keep, and so do offers."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:32
msgid "My nephew's a journeyman restorer, and he's idle. A dwarf workshop at the back of your shop: {price}, and he works for his keep."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:33
msgid "Ha! He'll mend things you didn't know were broken."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:33
msgid "Hmph. Ask me again in a few days."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:35
msgid "A lodestone from Ironroot's deep seam. Iron can't stir near it, and the Maw's demon gold is iron under the gilt. {price}. A dwarf knows iron."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:36
msgid "Keep it away from your purse. Ha!"
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:36
msgid "It's been in the ground a thousand years. It'll wait."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:38
msgid "My customers come after dark, friend. Keep your door open at night and they'll come to you too: {price}, and I'll send them round."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:39
msgid "Wonderful. You'll never know they were mine."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:39
msgid "Your loss, friend. The night's long."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:41
msgid "A royal warrant. The King... owes me a favour. Hang it over your door and the court will buy from you: {price}, for the Crown's fee."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:42
msgid "By appointment to the Crown. Don't let him down."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:42
msgid "Another day, then. The King's patient."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:44
msgid "My clients ask the cards what they want, dear, and then they want it. For {price} I'll send them to you, two more commissions a week."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:45
msgid "The cards said you would."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:45
msgid "The cards said you might not. They'll say otherwise soon."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:47
msgid "My own restorer, from the palace workshops: the finest hands in Aldmark. I'll lend him to you for {price}. Appearances, you understand."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:48
msgid "Charming. Do look after him."
msgstr ""

#: scripts/Core/Offers.cs:48
msgid "How disappointing. I may ask again."
msgstr ""

